name: Minimal brand direction
description: Trust Driving Solution visual direction for all public-facing pages
 type: design
---
Use Paper & Ink colors: #F5F3EE background, #E8E4DD secondary, #2D2D2D charcoal, #087A4B brand green, with existing #F2C230 gold sparingly. Use Space Grotesk headings and DM Sans body. Favor asymmetric 60/40 compositions, generous whitespace, minimal borders, few cards, and restrained motion.
